---
/** Selo de endosso "by Harpia Tech Studio" (documento-mestre, seção 2: monoespaçada, acento azul). */
---

<span class="selo-harpia">
  <span class="by">by</span> Harpia <span class="tech">Tech</span> Studio
</span>

<style>
  .selo-harpia {
    font-family: var(--pc-fonte-mono);
    font-size: var(--pc-t-xs);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--pc-tinta-suave);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .by {
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
  .tech {
    color: var(--pc-azul);
  }
</style>
